<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vitalink Pharmacy cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vitalink Pharmacy cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schroder Wertheim &amp; Co said on Thursday it lowered its rating on the shares of Vitalink Pharmacy Services Inc to in-line performer from an &quot;outperform significantly&quot; rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Vitalink Pharmacy shares were off 3/8 at 18-3/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
